#! ia 1.0

@move Observation
  meaning
    says "Take in what is actually there — the move that reads state without changing it."
    answers "Does the request read what is there and leave it unchanged?"
  data
    order 0

@move Execution
  meaning
    says "Carry out the authorized action — the move that changes state."
    answers "Does the request change state by carrying out authorized work itself?"
  data
    order 1

@move Delegation
  meaning
    says "Hand bounded work to another actor — the move that assigns work while the delegator keeps responsibility and grants no new authority."
    answers "Does the request pass bounded work to another actor while keeping responsibility for it?"
  data
    order 2

@move Synthesis
  meaning
    says "Combine separate findings into one account — the move that produces a whole from parts."
    answers "Does the request pull separate findings into one account?"
  data
    order 3

@move Verification
  meaning
    says "Check a claim against evidence — the move that decides whether something holds."
    answers "Does the request test a claim against evidence to settle whether it holds?"
  data
    order 4

